1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,850 --> 00:01:56,220
There's nothing good in the recent auctions.

25
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:57,830
It's disappointing.

26
00:01:58,290 --> 00:01:59,840
Bear with it,

27
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,340
the 4 major sects have been looking for treasures recently.

28
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:04,830
We'd be lucky if there were any left.

29
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:08,530
What are they trying to...

30
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,740
I heard that

31
00:02:12,050 --> 00:02:13,820
they are going to the Celestial Realm.

32
00:02:18,890 --> 00:02:20,610
I used almost all of my artifacts

33
00:02:20,450 --> 00:02:22,420
in the war against Xue Yue.

34
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:24,580
Many sects are looking forward

35
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:26,590
to the opening of the Celestial Realm.

36
00:02:26,410 --> 00:02:28,340
I have to be fully prepared.

37
00:02:29,090 --> 00:02:30,220
The first step

38
00:02:30,650 --> 00:02:32,980
is to refine another Restriction Flag.

39
00:02:54,890 --> 00:02:56,050
This is...

40
00:03:02,330 --> 00:03:04,500
Do you want this ?

41
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:48,420
It can improve my Spirit Beast's cultivation ?

42
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,420
Wait here,

43
00:04:12,770 --> 00:04:15,020
I'm going to the Land of the Ancient God.

44
00:04:25,050 --> 00:04:27,460
As long as I don't enter the Ancient God trials,

45
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:29,820
Tuo Sen shouldn't notice that I am here.

46
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,870
Even if he does,

47
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:33,700
with my current cultivation,

48
00:04:33,890 --> 00:04:35,900
I should be able to leave this place.

49
00:04:40,330 --> 00:04:42,690
I refined a flag in the Sea of Devils before

50
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:45,410
but it triggered a tribulation and I was injured.

51
00:04:45,170 --> 00:04:46,750
The Land of the Ancient God

52
00:04:46,890 --> 00:04:48,510
is a realm of its own

53
00:04:48,370 --> 00:04:50,770
so the tribulation shouldn't be able to fall.

54
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:04,900
This is the last one.

55
00:05:09,230 --> 00:05:10,700
If my is guess wrong

56
00:05:10,970 --> 00:05:12,850
and the tribulation falls now,

57
00:05:12,770 --> 00:05:15,060
it will be hard to protect the flag.

58
00:05:15,410 --> 00:05:16,980
But if I stop now,

59
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:20,530
the flag won't reach the first stage and will lack strength.

60
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:23,110
It will hardly help me in the Celestial Realm.

61
00:05:26,850 --> 00:05:28,300
I will gamble !

62
00:06:01,010 --> 00:06:02,100
I won the gamble.

63
00:06:03,890 --> 00:06:07,070
I don't need to worry about tribulations in the Land of the Ancient God.

64
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:08,740
Let's keep adding restrictions,

65
00:06:09,250 --> 00:06:12,220
maybe I can hit the second stage.

66
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,810
When it does,

67
00:06:13,810 --> 00:06:15,340
its power will be doubled.

68
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:26,370
Note: Wang Lin refined non-specialized restriction flags before.
Now that he knows more restrictions, he is refining a pure attack restriction flag.

69
00:06:22,290 --> 00:06:24,700
3 days later

70
00:06:35,170 --> 00:06:36,300
With my cultivation,

71
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,940
the second stage is still a step away.

72
00:06:39,810 --> 00:06:40,860
It's okay,

73
00:06:41,050 --> 00:06:43,620
the next tribulation the flag will cause

74
00:06:43,890 --> 00:06:47,690
will be able to save me in a life or death situation.

75
00:06:52,440 --> 00:07:09,690
Note: This scene was originally cut from episode 35, at that time the Blood Sea Warriors give Wang Lin their artifacts to guarantee his safety

76
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,980
This artifact is called the Huan Yuan Beast Trap.

77
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:59,860
Any beast in the world can be controlled by it for a short time.

78
00:07:00,450 --> 00:07:03,060
In theory, you just need to have enough spiritual energy.

79
00:07:03,250 --> 00:07:05,460
The stronger the beast is,

80
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,660
the more it will consume spiritual energy.

81
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:09,260
Use it wisely.

82
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,470
It would be great to capture

83
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,530
another beast with this.

84
00:07:16,170 --> 00:07:17,670
Even if I fail,

85
00:07:17,490 --> 00:07:19,010
I can always just leave.

86
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:29,010
Why is the spiritual energy so thin here ?

87
00:07:31,170 --> 00:07:32,880
Desolate beasts !

88
00:08:09,950 --> 00:08:12,980
Wow, 2 Desolate Beasts are fighting.

89
00:08:12,770 --> 00:08:15,380
Wrong, this toad isn't a Desolate Beast.

90
00:08:15,690 --> 00:08:18,140
It's only a high quality Spirit Beast.

91
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,410
It's still able to fight back,

92
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,770
it must be special.

93
00:08:43,450 --> 00:08:45,020
This Flood Dragon is powerful !

94
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,540
Master, let's capture it.

95
00:08:47,050 --> 00:08:48,660
With my current cultivation,

96
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,700
I can't subdue Desolate Beasts.

97
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:53,980
But a high quality Spirit Beast is worth a shot.

98
00:08:53,850 --> 00:08:55,980
But can I escape this Flood Dragon ?

99
00:08:56,410 --> 00:08:57,940
It's gonna be tight.

100
00:09:12,170 --> 00:09:14,540
If you don't want to die, don't struggle !

101
00:09:34,970 --> 00:09:35,820
Master,

102
00:09:35,770 --> 00:09:37,100
are you okay ?

103
00:09:38,730 --> 00:09:40,750
This toad is really powerful.

104
00:09:40,570 --> 00:09:42,450
The moment it was captured,

105
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:45,090
almost all my spiritual energy was absorbed by it.

106
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:09,340
So this beast is a Thunder Toad.

107
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:11,700
The beast trap

108
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:14,130
will regularly absob spiritual energy from my body.

109
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,900
to maintain control of the Thunder Toad.

110
00:10:16,370 --> 00:10:18,480
From now on, I need to prepare in advance

111
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,780
because if this happens during a fight,

112
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,140
it can be very dangerous.

113
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:39,620
Why are they fighting ?

114
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,700
Enough !

115
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:55,170
I need to catch my breath,

116
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,420
I can't make mistakes.

117
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,850
6 days later

118
00:11:18,090 --> 00:11:19,740
It's been 6 days !

119
00:11:19,610 --> 00:11:21,890
Aren't you guys done already !?

120
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:39,420
It's over...

121
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,780
Master, wake up.

122
00:11:40,570 --> 00:11:42,660
There's a big one coming.

123
00:11:54,090 --> 00:11:57,300
With my cultivation, I'm afraid I can't stop this one.

124
00:12:16,810 --> 00:12:18,940
Where are we going next ?

125
00:12:19,490 --> 00:12:20,940
The Foreign Battlefield.

126
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:30,260
Today, the Foreign Battlefield opens once again.

127
00:12:30,690 --> 00:12:34,140
I hope the elites of the country of Wuwen can seize this opportunity

128
00:12:34,530 --> 00:12:37,340
to raise their cultivations !

129
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,300
Thank you, Lord Envoy.

130
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:37,140
Sun Wen
Gong Sun country's Envoy
Late stage Nacent Soul

131
00:12:59,770 --> 00:13:00,500
This...

132
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:02,130
This is...

133
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:04,140
Why are there so many wandering souls ?!

134
00:13:04,490 --> 00:13:07,020
Is the Foreign Battlefield collapsing ?

135
00:13:05,970 --> 00:13:07,590
What's going on ?!

136
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:10,370
Someone's in there ?

137
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,610
How did he get in ?

138
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:14,420
I'm afraid that this fellow cultivator is in a pinch.

139
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:50,380
Junior Sun Wen,

140
00:13:50,450 --> 00:13:52,100
greets Senior.

141
00:13:52,650 --> 00:13:54,580
Greetings Senior.

142
00:13:56,050 --> 00:13:57,420
Where am I ?

143
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:00,020
Senior,

144
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:01,780
this is the country of country Wuwen.

145
00:14:12,570 --> 00:14:14,300
How can such a person be here ?

146
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:16,910
I feel like I just met my sect's Ancestor.

147
00:14:17,010 --> 00:14:18,530
That was scary !

148
00:14:24,770 --> 00:14:26,940
I have a Restriction Flag, a Thunder Toad,

149
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:29,940
wandering souls and ancient artifacts ready.

150
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,090
Even the 3 swords sheaths

151
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:34,410
are being refined by my Origin Soul.

152
00:14:35,290 --> 00:14:36,420
Now,

153
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,780
one last step...

154
00:14:43,850 --> 00:14:47,140
1 year later

155
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:51,980
Alright.

156
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:03,350
The past year,

157
00:15:03,210 --> 00:15:06,430
the sword sheaths have been refined one by one.

158
00:15:06,450 --> 00:15:09,160
The artifacts I got from the Blood Sea Warriors

159
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:11,100
are finally under my control.

160
00:15:11,770 --> 00:15:14,930
But I still can't completely open this scroll

161
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,890
that I got in the Sea of Devils.

162
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:20,450
Note: This is the scroll I was talking about in the note of episode 24

163
00:15:36,450 --> 00:15:37,660
The day

164
00:15:37,610 --> 00:15:39,060
has finally come.

165
00:15:55,890 --> 00:15:58,060
It's finally starting.

166
00:15:58,290 --> 00:15:59,940
Little friend,

167
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:03,260
make a good use of the straw hat I lent you.

168
00:16:03,330 --> 00:16:06,820
Otherwise, I'm afraid you won't make it.

169
00:16:07,290 --> 00:16:08,420
Grandpa,

170
00:16:08,290 --> 00:16:09,860
can you continue the story ?

171
00:16:09,810 --> 00:16:11,820
Yes, Grandpa, please continue.

172
00:16:11,930 --> 00:16:13,060
Sure, sure.

173
00:16:14,250 --> 00:16:17,350
It's said that an accident many years ago

174
00:16:17,150 --> 00:16:20,340
caused the death of all the ancient Celestials.

175
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:24,260
The Celestial Realm was shattered into fragments.

176
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:27,100
But the cultivators didn't give up.

177
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:30,460
When the gates of the Celestial Realm open again,

178
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:34,210
those who obtained a Rain Cauldron will rush in

179
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:37,500
to look for its remaining treasures.

180
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:10,890
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

181
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:17,050
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

182
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:20,990
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

183
00:17:20,770 --> 00:17:24,920
and like many other unseparable things.

184
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:30,930
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

185
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:37,940
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

186
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:43,790
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

187
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:48,470
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

188
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:51,960
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

189
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:57,950
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

190
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,150
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

191
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:06,070
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

192
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:11,920
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

193
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:15,850
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

194
00:18:15,810 --> 00:18:19,630
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

195
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:25,670
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

196
00:18:25,490 --> 00:18:29,750
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

197
00:18:29,530 --> 00:18:33,570
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

198
00:18:33,910 --> 00:18:39,400
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

199
